<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0709_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aiden</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO!\nSwap numbers with me, old buddy! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Call me sometime!\nI’ll call you sometimes too!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">No way!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, ayo!\nThis time, let’s get our\fnumbers swapped, old buddy! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wah ha ha! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nHere go that Dawn Stone you wanted.\rHere you go.\r...And now that you got what you came\nfor, SCRAM! I got a BIKE to ride!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s dangerous to talk on the phone\nwhile ridin’ Cycling Road, but\fsometimes I ain’t got no choice!\fI’m doin’ it RIGHT NOW!\rIf you nearby, let’s talk in person!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} got WAY strong!\rIt knocked out a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} in, like,\ntwo seconds!\fWAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!\r...What?\nYou think I’m cappin’?\rPut a lid on it! Nothin’ but facts!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} got\nCRAZY strong!\rWe can go catch {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} now!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I came across a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} on the\nroad.\rOutta nowhere, out it jump! I fell off\nmy Bike tryna not hit it!\rI got scraped up, but it’s all good.\nI’m nice to wild homies!\fMy bike ain’t. It’s in a tree.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! Right now, I’m\non {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\rDon’t run, don’t hide, just get over\nhere and fight me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen! Here I wait on good ol’\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\rTime for us to scrap again,\nfair and square, so come alone!\rWait...\nBring your homies with you!\fWithout homies, we can’t scrap!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You... You got a homie with you, right?\rThat’s... pretty sweet, ain’t it?\rIf you was flyin’ down the road fast as\nyou could, like me, your homies\fcouldn’t keep up.\rMakes me kinda jealous, to tell the\ntruth.\fMy homie took the bus.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! I picked up somethin’ FIRE!\rI checked with somebody who know\nthis stuff. They said Dawn Stone.\rIf you want it, I’m on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so come get it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0709_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen! Pick up the pace and pick up\nthis Dawn Stone! On {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
</body>
